Package: qsuite
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: QSuite contributors
Depends: python3 (@PYMIN@), python3 (@PYMAX@), python3-venv, ca-certificates, openssl, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: QSuite authenticated server management foundations
 Explicit operations, local accounts, SQLite state, a closed privilege broker,
 web monitoring, isolated terminal transport and independent security observation.
 This initial release does not enable WAN or start services automatically.
